                                <color key="backgroundColor" systemColor="systemBackgroundColor"/>
                                <string key="text">• Tap “Start” to begin today’s puzzle.
• A blurred or partial bird image will appear.
• Enter your guess in the text field.

• If the guess is incorrect, the next image becomes clearer.
• You have 5 attempts across 6 images.
• When you guess correctly (or run out of attempts), the final image is shown.

• After the puzzle, you will see:
    – Bird name  
    – Attempts used  
    – Photographer + license  
    – Link to learn more about the bird

• Each completed puzzle is automatically saved in History.
</string>
